## Final Certification

**All 4 Red Team gates have passed.** The openOODA public website is **CERTIFIED FOR DEPLOYMENT** with the following caveats:

- The primary install entry point is the hardened hybrid installer at `https://openooda.org/install.sh`
- Gate 4 residual warnings (CSP, framing, form endpoint) should be remediated in the next security sprint
- The 7 advisory warnings do not constitute blocking veto conditions under the current threat model

